  "componentSets": [
    {
      "name": "Select",
      "id": "5422:92",
      "description": "Dropdown selector for picking one option from a predefined list. 12 variants: size (sm, md) × state (default, hover, focus, open, disabled, error). The field itself is 32px (sm) / 40px (md); with label and helper the component measures 66 / 76px. Drawn heights are the visible control; the 44×44px WCAG hit area is padded in code (no target-size variable exists yet). Trailing chevron rotates when open. Use when options are fewer than ~7 — beyond that, switch to Autocomplete for typeahead, or a multi-select pattern. SelectOpen (sibling component) is the expanded panel.",
